# Expense Tracker

A modern Expense Tracker application built using Python, Streamlit, SQLite, and Plotly.

## Features

- Add Income
- Add Expenses
- Dashboard
- Monthly Reports
- Category-wise Analysis
- Budget Tracking
- Export Reports

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- SQLite
- Plotly
- Pandas

## Project Status

🚧 Under Development